    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18, 18.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 18, 18.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be bydele . Bydele gebyrað þæt he for his wycan sy weorces frigra ðonne oðer man . forðan he sceal beon oftræde . eac him gebyreð sum landsticce for his geswince.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the beadle [The officer responsible for gathering men to council] To the beadle it is due that, on account of his office, he should be freer of work than other men, because he must be always available, also a portion of land is due to him for his labour.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[18] Be bydele. Bydele gebyrað, þæt he for his wycan sy weorces frigra ðonne oðer man; forðan he sceal beon oftræde. [18.1] Eac him gebyreð sum landsticce for his geswince.</ab>
      </div>
